#other files
# Documentation is version-controlled. `*.md` was ignored here, which kept every
# document out of the repo — the roadmap, the client issue list, the onboarding
# playbooks, the engineering guide — all living on one laptop only.

# Migrations are version-controlled. 22 of them were excluded here, including
# guide_commission_settings and the chats constraint changes, which meant the schema
# could not be rebuilt from this repo and nobody could tell which had ever been applied.

# TypeScript incremental build cache — stale copies make `tsc --noEmit` skip real errors
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
